        "original_id": "cff1ffb5-a051-5122-9a33-d946665560ba",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Donna Freedman, Margot Robbie, Ringo Brown\n- Works: Neighbours\n- Topics: Casting, award nominations, character storylines, relationships\n\nFacts:\n- Margot Robbie played Donna Freedman, also known as Donna Brown, in the Australian soap opera Neighbours.\n- Margot Robbie was later cast in Neighbours for 2008 to 2011, and that role earned her two Logie Award nominations.\n- Ringo Brown is a character in Neighbours whose storylines include an ongoing eating disorder, a bus crash, a relationship with an older woman, the collapse of a warehouse roof at an illegal dance party, and an on-off relationship with Donna Freedman.",
